              <td>Water, biological, food, lab media</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>EPDM</td>
              <td>1,000–3,000+ hours</td>
              <td>Acids, alkalis, abrasive slurries, ozone</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Norprene-type TPE</td>
              <td>1,500–3,000+ hours</td>
              <td>Long-life general industrial duty</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
